+ * control, audio) as datagrams, and its TCP connections (HTTP, HTTPS, RTSP) over a small retransmitting
+ * stream layer. Only the host's six streaming ports are reachable through it.
+ *
+ * The player connects to a stand-in address on this phone (127.77.x.y) on the host's own port numbers
